{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2022-07-28 15:10:00', 'title': 'BOEING NAMES BRIAN BESANCENEY AS NEW COMMUNICATIONS CHIEF', 'text': "ARLINGTON, VA. , JULY 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOEING COMPANY [NYSE:BA] TODAY NAMED BRIAN BESANCENEY AS THE COMPANY'S SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF COMMUNICATIONS OFFICER EFFECTIVE SEPTEMBER 6, 2022."}